# What a deployment does not need.
#
# The site reads its works from Supabase Storage at runtime; the folders below
# are inputs to the import tooling and the local demo, and they added ~60MB of
# upload time and build disk to every deployment without ever being served.

# Starting assets (210MB): they were already processed into public/works/ and
# uploaded to Storage. Kept in the repository as the source for re-running the
# tools.
SampleAds/

# The local demo database and its files (36MB) — local development only.
local-supabase-data/
tools/local-supabase/

# Tools never run on Vercel: they build assets from SampleAds/ or talk to the
# local demo. Kept because the app does not import from this folder — the
# generated modules live in src/lib/works/.
tools/
